<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain to launch new English-language daily.</title>
<headline>Bahrain to launch new English-language daily.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new English-language newspaper, Bahrain Tribune, will publish its first edition in Bahrain on Saturday, the Gulf News Agency reported on Monday.</p>
<p>Bahrain Tribune, owned by al-Ayam publishing house, will be Bahrain's fourth daily and the Gulf Arab state's second English-language newspaper.</p>
</text>
